Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mode Nash, no survival day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out. We tell me no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unmey. You can turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't stop beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.22,0:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On Earth, much akin to how the ratio of\Nwater to land is seven parts to three,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the souls of living things\Nhave a perfect set amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crucial to maintain\Nthe balance of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As the population of Earth increases,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't be a mistake to assume that\Nin accordance with that rising number,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the same amount of living\Ncreatures are in decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that the number of souls\Nthat exist in full is a fixed constant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me posit a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What if one person were able\Nto possess several more,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,or perhaps even thousands\Nmore souls simultaneously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think such a\Nperson has the power to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What will that person's future hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And how soon will it come to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have absolutely no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's definitely a fascinating\Nconcept to imagine coming true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what is it you\Nwant me to do exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sports maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My request to you has to do\Nwith this specific bone I hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to use your power to\Nattempt to modify the state of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can take\Nthis bone and resurrect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it from a human body or something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is irrelevant to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I took possession\Nof it from an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just one single piece\Nof a far more complex hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I resurrect that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you have a stockpile of all\Nhis other assorted bones somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible to resurrect\Nsomething from just one bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Geo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one bone of his that remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest became dust and\Nscattered like ashes on the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No longer of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do this for me, sports maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're incapable of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,well then I'll be forced to take back\Nin full the power I gave you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry because\NI've already done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Start talking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with the bone, fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where his bone went?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You best answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are we sure it's really Days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it with my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bizarre to imagine it would\Nmove around on its own, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's here somewhere. I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can actually feel it moving\Nwithin the walls of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Start looking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.33,0:04:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This can only mean that\NI was right all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That the way to heaven he kept\Ntantalizing me with does in fact exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and this proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The search will continue,\Nbut let's suspend it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We must let it decide its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll observe it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then combine it with\NJotaro Kujo's memories for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone to find out the\Nreal truth once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the bone's presence at the\NMaximum Security disciplinary wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,right as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems someone might\Nhave picked it up, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw were Sports Maximum's\Nmemories that Aramis found by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Jolene's seen this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jolene make it so she can\Ngo to the discipline cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,just to find that same\Nbone belonging to Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's way too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pale Snake is definitely going to do\Nhis best to take out Jolene for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,especially now that Sports\NMaximum's memories were discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolene stays there by\Nherself, she's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm alive\Nright now is Jolene, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I have no idea\Nwhat I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,even weather forecast who's\Nrecovering in the medical
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,wing now wouldn't be able\Nto go over there either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to be helpful\Nin some way too, but
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the isolated strict discipline\Ncell in the maximum security
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,disciplinary wing is on the\Nsoutheast side of the men's wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to get on the prisoner transport\Nvehicle so there's no shortcut or bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even been there,\Ndespite knowing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't protect Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all I want to do,\Nbut I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need from you is to take me\Nto that building on the down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Crisscross, are you\Navailable to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand user, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you born with\Nthis power or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it's like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy will never cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything if you'll help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get me to the\NDiscipline Cell building,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Both kindness and generosity just\Naren't part of his personality. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, wait, so you haven't\Nheard of the name Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a cold-blooded murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, his full name\Nis Narciso Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know what might have triggered\Nit, but since he was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he's had one bizarre habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not so much a\Nhabit as it is a syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,One that compels him to take\Neverything he touches apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's seemingly no limit to\Nwhat he'll dismantle either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he took apart a neighbor's Porsche, and\Nhe was in the hospital for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even taken apart a\Nhigh-voltage telephone pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And one time, when he was 21,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he went to visit his then-girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,showing up unannounced late\Nthat night at her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When he opened the door, he found\Nher in bed with another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to ensure they'd\Nnever be together again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so he separated them into dozens of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,irreparable pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He was arrested and went through\Na psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The results
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,were normal, and that's why he\Nended up here at the aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no telling what he would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do if weather forecast wasn't\Nholding him down for safety's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So Please forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, but I have to get to Jolene,\Nand I'll never make it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if I could ask for a\Nperfect backup, it'd be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's bizarre, this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If asking nicely won't work, I'll\Nlet my FF bullets do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty persuasive. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As it stands, though, there's a pretty\Ngood chance my first shot will go way wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I even supposed to aim?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go in like it's the kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he won't even\Nacknowledge me, much less obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unnerving, but I have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the whole reason why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want, I'll\Nprotect Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, as you say, cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,if she's looking for that bone or whatever\Nit is that seems to be in such demand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll help find that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be getting attacked\Neven as we speak right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you scheming to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just as I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect her with every\Npower I have. But... but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I've come to like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything about her from my first view.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, I respect her resolve to go\Nto the discipline cell for her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite admirable,\Nto say the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep her safe through this,\Nthen I plan on making her my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're FF, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'll do anything, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, give us your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No marriage is official without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just say what I think he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going insane here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to marry Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Putzai, you set off a bomb\Nin there, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's in the wall, with the time delay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's Anastasia's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the power of diver drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Find an occupation that\Nbest fits their true
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Personality, a king would\Nfeel like a king and a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,would feel like a chef\Nsee that's what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to live truly the same goes\Nfor stands strength and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,weakness do not apply i\Nphrase that badly i meant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it more like when little\Nkids debate about who'd win
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,in a fight say stallone\Nor van Diam in that case
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the stand i named survivor\NSurvivor is the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beyond control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The name sounds strong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the year 1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Lorraine region of France, a\Ngroup of six hikers met with disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All six of them perished horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After the recon team examined the\Narea where the tragedy occurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they found evidence of brutal combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They had all fought\Nliterally to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they had attacked one\Nanother with so much force
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,their bones shattered\Ninstantly upon contact
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,a tooth that had broken\Noff after being struck
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,was found half buried in\Na nearby rock the damage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,was so horrific even\Nthe so-called winner was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,hurt too badly to descend\Nand died of his wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as i found out\Nlater those people had
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,stayed at a mountain hut\Nthe night before and had an
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,altercation with the owner\Nof it. One of the women
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,there crudely insulted\Nthe man in fact she told
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,him his body odor was\Nvile is it safe to assume
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the owner of the hut was\Nthe stand user that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but what did the owner do\Nwhat was it that compelled
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,those people to fight\Neach other to the death
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the answer is nothing at\Nall nothing externally
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,at least But deep in the\Nrecesses of his brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,anger was slowly beginning to brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before much longer, that anger evolved\Nenough to become a weak electric signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This signal then descended\Nthrough his entire
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,nervous system and flowed into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The electric signal traveled\Nalong the surface of the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,directly toward the six people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the ground and shoes to better conduct\Nelectricity, the ground needs to be wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The electrical power a\Nnerve carries at any given
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,time measures a mere seven\Nhundredths of a volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how little power that stand has.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Survivor's attacks make one feel\Nnothing, and it does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Its effects don't come close to things like\Nseverely injuring or controlling people,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,nor weakening them, or\Neven knocking them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't inflict one external action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All it does is make them mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It awakens combative instinct in the\Nlimbic system of people's brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little at first,\Nand then it proliferates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because one woman said he smelled bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,he drove the entire group\Ninto a bloody brawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One that ended in carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you said it was\Nbeyond anyone's control, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's an unusable stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't distinguish\Nbetween enemies and allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's infighting among your\Nsubordinates, your organization falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, may I have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't need it, just the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to remove the\Npower and keep it as a disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if so, that just might work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact right person, at the\Nexact right place and moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that time might be nigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, these mushrooms\Nmight be okay to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,FE40536, it's time for your shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Up and at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes! Ha! I told you! She\Ndid it! Look at that! She hid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She scurried under that\Nbed like a cockroach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I win for this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be $20. A deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay up, pal. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All I got on me right now is $15.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a discount?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, now I just have to feel around\Nwith my thread and hope I find the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of bone is it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironic, I don't even know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I know it's somewhere\Nin this discipline cell building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone in here has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get my hands on it first, that\Ncreepy palesnake will soon follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, there's my father's stolen memory\Ndisk that the bastard is still holding onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, park it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you to stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's the over-undersome\Ndrama at the Marlins game tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not holding my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The starting pitcher and the on-field\Nbroadcaster lady just broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be off his game tonight for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you the $15 from early.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, do you even have the cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to get yanked\Nin the first inning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Three up, three down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This valve gets a little sticky sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing else to change into\Nunless I go back to the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I splashed\Nyou on purpose man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? You're\Ncrazy. I didn't touch you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could\Nhave hit you that hard
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Back the fuck off, Westwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pay back to bits liquor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, I give!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I give, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, please! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have a change of\Nclothes, I'll lend you some!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that gonna be okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's stop this shit already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Westwood, I've never seen you this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did someone put\Nhot sauce in your shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, little buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to you, old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You pack a good punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the actual hell is\Nwrong with these assholes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm getting excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What definition?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What sparkling vigor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see every point of\Npower in that ripped lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single muscle is\Na gorgeous work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can tap right into\Nwhere all his strengths are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the raw beauty of\Nbattle, and I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this just got even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with their backs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things that look like\Nflashlights or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just FYI, you have no chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna reduce you to\Na stain on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am a golden god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this actually a stand attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that guard the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the enemy hasn't revealed itself yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This abnormality is a stand attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not give what is holy to the dogs,\Nlest they trample them under their feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and turn and tear you in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Matthew 7-6
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, Sports Maximum is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how or why\Nthey were able to find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is no doubt they've\Nread through Maximum's memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is a rather large problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To fix this, I've sent four STAN users\Nto the Disciplined Cell building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolene Kujo has found\Nher way to the Disciplined
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Cell in pursuit of Dio's priceless bone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow her to live anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will make sure it's done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how it happens as long as\Nit's in the Disciplined Cell building.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four people will do\Nanything and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to ensure the total eradication\Nof Jotaro's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, is he letting them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your point\Nof power in all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see where your\Nstrengths lie from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your most dominant muscle groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Fight Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,think I cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.44,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.38,0:23:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.70,0:24:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
